{"id":"td-4155","category":"teardown","cover":"🔧","region":"global","publishedAt":"2026-08-29","tags":["拆解分析","启境"],"title":{"zh":"【车灯拆解2612】启境GT7尾灯","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"今天，小编为大家带来启境GT7尾灯的拆解(GT7车灯速评传送门）。这款车是另一个典型的漫反射灯光设计的尾灯，从颜值角度还是挺好看的。\n\n这个灯主要由上下两部分组成，上方的漫反射饰板","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"今天，小编为大家带来启境GT7尾灯的拆解(GT7车灯速评传送门）。这款车是另一个典型的漫反射灯光设计的尾灯，从颜值角度还是挺好看的。\n\n这个灯主要由上下两部分组成，上方的漫反射饰板，和下方的信号灯部分。设计上纵向比较深入，在灯的上部有一个盖板，用来贴合钣金处。\n\n盖板取下后就可以看到漫反射的光学设计原理，采用LED+反射碗的形式。\n\n该PCBA上，有8组LED，每组内有红光LED做位置灯，和蓝光LED做ADS灯，只不过短期内的ADS灯应该很难再应用了。\n\n下方的信号灯部分主要由两块厚壁组成，拆开来看，采用的是双厚壁的光学方案。也就是说，一共有4块厚壁。\n\nPCBA是两块灯板和一块驱动板。两块灯板上方都是双芯LED，转向位置刹车灯功能均在上方。\n\n这里发现一个亮点，在驱动板上有一款国产芯片，即丝印为“IND23024”的芯片，该芯片为24通道高边恒流LED驱动芯片，来自英迪芯微。官方资料显示，iND23024系列支持UART和私有ELINS总线通讯。\n\n最后，这款尾灯来自燎旺。","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/dengjuchaijie/4155.html","author":""},"media":{"images":["https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWEOAGZsUNiav0m7yA5JlFm2xDeH2KVLUmS63JLHu6C3D3rFk4VqF9W5Y3qdE98pOFQmNfPmrMA2iaxcMIkSLwAHzv1JicVTD1SO7k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWHUdHrskHf2LsNUGoUb7N0mYd2ibIZIUyaxD42IF2t5eY37LKcdMFks5cUAzlAavwzyibPFkKMf48fJZpnoULIv3DD5wu7dusnaQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWFFbxmGjS3lbDzHuSicsicxibNPJJZtc4fLa6X5ygGdXhfPLuxvr9diaGBut93NQtLstsJtY9Owh0xKmJdeAiaEz4FVA7JPSs3I9Ep4/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWH3DXWzYyeWIeK1YWhS2Pg35wKrBaCy1RDoslhhP7aWVwZrAC6HPgEaa9u5ic1ef0esI3fJxlDnR86DLetWl2zvZ4jXhBa3PG9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWF6NgCzFiaZKINAh7hsRjtFxvhdATSibVsyAFwpI7783h8CI32U6tgnx2NHwhZBrDy9AOscfJH3lD7ibP3mR79PtuETF458JibIjIU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWHJBWyIeIxicFdCuRIJYeLN7ePLJHgTVHW36OibEwA1oMsAjMZudp1OesAgBVbk2OeWLXwFAU1iaQ