","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWFZK0IuKP54bHNqJrDZBudDLtK625Q0feIVibmzHGgxHD1Ppric1B5Rzm255r7cyVE4ol9TBHeq4AX85muJ7nROUiajib6KFNKeu3Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"这里发现一个亮点，在驱动板上有一款国产芯片，即丝印为“IND23024”的芯片，该芯片为24通道高边恒流LED驱动芯片，来自英迪芯微。官方资料显示，iND23024系列支持UART和私有ELINS总线通讯。"},{"t":"img","v":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWEWxXIgfVK47C6SPURu8DTJc9YGgswvmn4ZKpYQVsQWp5ffJYPEZ2k3K5aPjB8PzNDhcjztAePh15cOJv4gk6IrI4YlXMibFwMU/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg&watermark=1"},{"t":"text","v":"最后，这款尾灯来自燎旺。"}],"coverImg":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/KTj61r3bYWEOAGZsUNiav0m7yA5JlFm2xDeH2KVLUmS63JLHu6C3D3rFk4VqF9W5Y3qdE98pOFQmNfPmrMA2iaxcMIkSLwAHzv1JicVTD1SO7k/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&watermark=1"}